  <item>
    <title>Vol.03｜没想到，这眼耳手鼻嘴戏还挺多！？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6794e437247d51713c3e0525</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6794e437247d51713c3e0525</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 13:28:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>写在前面：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>"当理性左脑撞上灵感右脑——欢迎光临观点交锋现场！"</span></p><span></span><p><span>蒙住眼睛，才能看见真相。这是一档由媒体人和文化创意者共同发起的，讨论时下热点话题、女性谈天说地的小阵地。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播自白】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>由于两位主播成长路径和表达风格的不同，对于同一话题会给出不一样的观点呈现方式，用贵阳本地话来说是“多少有点飞”，但没关系，对于内容的产出，我们同样用心。感谢听众朋友们的宽容，本节目不提供标准答案，让“表达”这件事情变得更加有趣，希望每次的双倍认知视角，都将成为打开新世界的门缝。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>写在前面：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>蒙住眼睛，才能看见真相。主播是阿蒙和阿找，这是一档由媒体人和文化创意者共同发起的，讨论时下热点话题、女性谈天说地的小阵地。</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家好久不见！这里是「思想蒙面」2025年的第一期，今天我们将用五感：听觉、味觉、触觉、视觉、嗅觉来回顾我们的2024！祝大家新年快乐！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿蒙：十年媒体从业者、野生插画师、拥有两只可爱小咪的铲屎官 小红书@阿蒙阿</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿找：山咔咔找诗社社长，前创新教育、乡村小学、补习机构老师；前品牌策划 、野生插画师、摄影师 小红书@找找大王</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容提要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>味觉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 偶像练习生安子的红烧肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl_uxC_qlvxuIAuY3TumMqLO2NUm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 独居女性最爱烤糍粑包豆腐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 全世界最爱吃蛋糕的阿找</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj6qV9OivCrJSaRqKQzuw3ivM_HF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 人和咖啡一样都有自己独特的风味</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjroO3xyzylOPBnGwPMFoI-qlAtQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 带着毛阿姨糯米饭逛观山湖公园</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嗅觉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> 与桂花味纠葛的三人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 对猫猫过敏的人还能不能养猫？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 面包复烤后的香味可以提高幸福感</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuXX-rAQzdg2apo0cArLlvL9-QC4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 吃前嗅一嗅，难道会更香？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPCHuDeFbej4zUvhijuqWrkHAgU.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>触觉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 绘画成为新的自我表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 通过插画认识了更多有趣的人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtbUgivqdK-ZFYJyMDT-R3Iue2IR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1730">28:50</a> 拥抱是最美好的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 用绘画去记录童年秘密</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frnhs74NbelrZvSjPJ0X9oo5hqSz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 用绘画连接友谊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsit6TnDWyourpHrN6fbuTCgnBNT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 满100个订阅者抽5个送定制周边</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>视觉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2307">38:27</a> 二十天拍了2000张照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a> 捡便宜干货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a> 跨年买花记</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpsh3u5jm0xMKTRCqKb6Kle0WMdf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 俯身时拾垃圾，抬首亦追梦人，谁能说这不算摇滚？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjezajeHkTz3oJDDQ2Tdd_zqi8ZM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2654">44:14</a> 《机器人之梦》告诉我们的事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrI6zQ021beSVCqPTLjCKhu1KiH.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>听觉</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> &nbsp;让耳朵愉悦的三档播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3413">56:53</a> 阿找最喜欢的是“胡b”播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3478">57:58</a> 用感性的内容对抗用理性的规则</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三个关键词总结2024</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3585">59:45</a> &nbsp;哪有那么多可能性啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3632">01:00:32</a> &nbsp;其实也没那么笃定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3737">01:02:17</a> 好吧，那就做不完美的自己咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3772">01:02:52</a> &nbsp;每一天都值得庆祝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">01:03:34</a> &nbsp;开心也好，不开心也没关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3834">01:03:54</a> &nbsp;别害怕受伤</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目中使用的音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Snow at the Beach（电影《机器人之梦》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：September（电影《机器人之梦》）</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：阿找 阿蒙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671371e352e561d3c8d46a90/lovyY4TD3JEVPiyq5DuzAFKFSaPa.m4a" length="63833177" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpX6Th_mU8b5DeD4wAqqKaQvXi5f.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
