span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1287">21:27</a> 女性教育的时代进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 每个阶段都应该有“出走的决心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> 女性生活方式的多样化探究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 阿找在饭桌上被审视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 男性对于女性的情绪易变的刻板印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 康德说人本身就是目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2065">34:25</a> 如何成为一个女鼓手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> 任何一种情绪都应该被看见</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> 女性应该活得更自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 女性的底气来自于自己的经济实力和精神独立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2551">42:31</a> 一拍即合的背后：两位主播都想要做“最像小孩的大人”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 期待以微观视角呈现五彩斑斓的灰</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期节目中使用的音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Favorite Rendezvous</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：滥俗的歌—汉堡黄</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【封面】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>王阿找</span></p>]]></description>
